    "pin": {
      "title": "Scaligero Castle (Sirmione)",
      "description": "Castle on Lake Garda in Sirmione, Italy",
      "extract": "The Scaligero Castle or Scaligero Castle of Sirmione is a fortress from the Scaliger era, an access point to the historical centre of Sirmione, on Lake Garda. It is one of Italy's best-preserved castles. In 2024, it was the 29th most visited attraction in Italy, with 262,095 visitors, and a total gross income of €1,125,881.",
      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scaligero_Castle_(Sirmione)",
